        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We aim to deliver our real estate services with high standards of environmental care and social responsibility, building on a collective strategy to develop a more resilient business, strengthen corporate reputation, reduce risk and drive long-term, sustainable value creation.",
